    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589020/extras/47b344b300848c16c76f0047f05fc50d.avif?t=1744997513\" /></div>Inspired by F\u00e9licien Rops\u2019 iconic painting, <i>Pornocrates</i> is an interactive work that blends social critique, stylized sensuality, and allegory. Taking on the role of the enigmatic queen of pleasure, players enter a symbolic universe where eroticism is treated as art, and human instincts are explored with refinement and boldness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game unfolds across three levels, each representing a hedonistic celebration in one of the hostess\u2019s private chambers. Sixteen illustrious guests \u2014 eccentric figures from diverse cultures \u2014 are challenged to navigate trials of charm, intelligence, and emotional surrender. The goal is not merely to win Pornocrates\u2019 attention, but to achieve a profound, symbolic, and overwhelming connection with the ideal of absolute pleasure she embodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589020/extras/1a7d0b0d40dbc940d1d43e1fb82299f5.avif?t=1744997513\" /></div>Those who succeed earn not only material rewards but also a place of honor in her intimate circle. Those who fail undergo a transformative journey: they become &quot;Pigs&quot; \u2014 an allegorical symbol of unrefined desire, greed, and self-degradation. But luxury bears a hidden warning: before the fall comes the judgment of others. And in this house of mirrors, all reflect their own vices.\u00a0<i>Pornocrates</i> is not a game about sex. It is a metaphor about power, desire, identity, and the fine line between the sublime and the grotesque.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u201c<strong>Pornography is simply a description of carnal pleasures; eroticism is the same description revalued, based on an idea of love or social life. Everything erotic is necessarily also pornographic.</strong>\u201d \u2014 Self-definition of Queen Pornocrates</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1589020/extras/3b71bda91f9a3028739e1411ceed158c.avif?t=1744997513\" /></div>Playing is extremely easy because you can use your computer's keyboard and mouse or you can choose a joystick. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">During the game you can:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Collect items are hidden in the mansion.<br>Protect yourself from attacks.<br>Read messages and save them in inventory to review later,</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>",
